    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer proudly offers for sale this wonderful three bedroom first floor apartment situated in a small and luxurious apartment complex in Passage West. \r\n\r\nThis apartment is in impeccable condition throughout having been extremely well cared for and beautifully finished by its current owner with high quality fixtures & fittings included. It benefits from lots of natural light flowing through its living space offering great space for one to enjoy its optimum position with stunning views over the harbour. It has a nice large open plan living/dining area with kitchen and has three generous bedrooms (1 en-suite) & main bathroom. The complex itself is superbly maintained and kept in pristine condition.\r\n\r\nThis fabulous apartment is most conveniently located to all amenities and services in Passage West and the hugely popular Passage Greenway that gives direct access to Blackrock village and the Marina while having a public bus service available at the entrance of the park.  It is also just a short commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport and Ringaskiddy, where a host of major multi-national pharmaceutical companies/employers are situated along with the Port of Cork & National Maritime College of Ireland. \r\n\r\nViewing of this rare opportunity to acquire one of these unique apartments ready for immediate occupation comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": ""
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 103 sq metres (1,108 sq ft)\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & Doors\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nDesignated parking\r\nSecure intercom system\r\nShowhouse condition throughout\r\nSpacious living and bedroom accommodation\r\nBeautiful views over harbour\r\nSmall residential complex\r\nEasy access to hugely popular Passage West Greenway\r\nMinutes’ walk to all amenities and services in Passage West\r\nShort commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy\r\n\r\nAnnual Management Fee is €2,300 per annum which covers the block insurance, refuse collection & maintenance of common area"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B 104964903"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Cork, continue into Passage West passing the playground on the left hand side as you enter the town. Pass the Post Office and take a right hand turn up to Church Hill. Continue up Church Hill and \"Sirius Heights\" is the circular three storey building situated on the left hand side,  indicated by our For Sale sign. Follow Eircode: T12 YV78"
      }
    ],
